note store/mvsalvage.om: the store build's seam for salvage/ (defines the names of server/nosalvage.om).
note /salvage, /salvage/ and everything under /salvage/ answer the 503 of store/moving.om; the forge
note row has no Salvage Yard entry and the stylesheet adds nothing.
text tmvsl "/salvage"
text tlcss ""
fn slroute to long
if mvunder tmvsl
ret mvans
end
ret 0
end
fn slnav to void
ret
end
